    "body": "**Before:** `sp-load-theme` from any buffer ended in the Dashboard.\n\n**Cause:** `sp-dashboard` hangs `sp-dashboard--theme-changed` on `enable-theme-functions` and `disable-theme-functions`. It ran `sp-dashboard-refresh` inside the Dashboard buffer, which kills and redraws it with `sp-dashboard-screen`, and that ends in `switch-to-buffer \"Dashboard\"`. `with-current-buffer` does not change the selected window, so the redraw put the Dashboard in whichever window you were using.\n\n**After:** the splash is redrawn inside `with-selected-window` of the window that already shows it, and not at all when no window does (the palette is still applied; `g` redraws a hidden Dashboard). The selection is restored by `with-selected-window`.\n\n**Checked** (Emacs 29.3, windows only): with the Dashboard in a second window the refresh runs there and the selected window stays; with no window showing it, no refresh runs. **Not checked:** the real Dashboard on macOS.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_013wuoefeVHQQNwZgJptsdeH)_",
